      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide rich\" style=\"padding: 56px 72px; background: #fbfaf7; color: #1f2937; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;\">\n  <style>\n    .rich .hl { background: #fef08a; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 3px; }\n    .rich .muted { color: #6b7280; }\n    .rich a { color: #047857; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n  </style>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #047857;\">🌱 2026 report</div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Emissions fell for the <span style=\"color: #047857;\">third <span style=\"text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 3px; text-underline-offset: 6px;\">straight</span> year</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Scope&nbsp;1 and 2 emissions dropped to <strong>41,200&nbsp;t CO<sub>2</sub>e</strong><sup>1</sup>, down <span class=\"hl\">18%</span> from 2025. Most of the change came from <em>switching two plants to renewable power</em> and <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #047857;\">electrifying the <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">last-mile</span> fleet</span>.</p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\" class=\"muted\">Full methodology in the <a href=\"https://example.com/report-2026\" style=\"color: #047857; font-weight: 600;\">2026 sustainability report</a> <span class=\"muted\">(pages 12–19)</span>.</p>\n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db; margin: 6px 0; width: 100%;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin: 0;\"><sup>1</sup> Market-based method. Figures rounded to the nearest 100&nbsp;t. <small>Data as of <code style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;\">2026-09-30</code>.</small></p>\n</div>"
